00:12:30,160 --> 00:12:33,500
我爱你 这真的有点难以启齿
I love you, and this is really hard for me to say,

346
00:12:33,500 --> 00:12:34,604
但是我...
but, I, um...

347
00:12:35,318 --> 00:12:37,006
我干了件蠢事
I did something stupid.

348
00:12:37,020 --> 00:12:39,340
我亲了前男友 我发誓这毫无意义
I kissed my ex-boyfriend. It meant nothing, I swear,

349
00:12:39,360 --> 00:12:40,480
我希望你可以原谅我
and I'm hoping you'll forgive me,

350
00:12:40,480 --> 00:12:42,040
我们可以当做这从没发生过
and we can forget this ever happened.

351
00:12:43,641 --> 00:12:45,509
不好意思 亲爱的 你那边卡住了
Sorry, love, you froze up.

352
00:12:45,581 --> 00:12:47,645
我什么也没听到
I-I-I missed the -- the whole thing.

353
00:12:47,645 --> 00:12:49,410
真糟糕 这...
Oh, that sucks. Um...

354
00:12:50,960 --> 00:12:53,700
这真的难以启齿 但我干了件很蠢的事
This is really hard for me, but I did something stupid.

355
00:12:53,700 --> 00:12:56,040
我亲了我的前男友 这并不代表什么 我...
I kissed my ex-boyfriend. It meant nothing, and I --

356
00:12:56,040 --> 00:12:57,320
不好意思 又卡了
Sorry, froze up again

357
00:12:57,380 --> 00:12:58,849
卡在了一个搞笑的位置
in the funniest position.

358
00:12:58,849 --> 00:13:01,300
你看上去像闻到了什么恶臭的东西
You look like you'd smelled something dreadful.

359
00:13:01,300 --> 00:13:02,720
-再说一遍 -行吧
- Have another go. - Okay.

360
00:13:02,720 --> 00:13:03,930
我搞砸了 我亲
I messed up, and I kiss--

361
00:13:03,930 --> 00:13:04,921
等一下
Wait!

362
00:13:05,700 --> 00:13:06,480
好了 说
Okay, go.

363
00:13:06,540 --> 00:13:07,720
我亲了前男友
I kissed my ex-boyfriend!

364
00:13:09,260 --> 00:13:10,580
该死 别卡了
Damn it, stop freezing!

365
00:13:12,520 --> 00:13:13,640
没卡
Not frozen.

366
00:13:15,360 --> 00:13:15,960
我震惊了
Shocked.

367
00:13:16,960 --> 00:13:18,080
事实上 我心碎了
Very hurt, actually.

368
00:13:18,500 --> 00:13:19,660
我真的很抱歉
I'm so sorry.

369
00:13:20,200 --> 00:13:21,200
那不代表什么 我们能
It meant nothing. Can --

370
00:13:21,497 --> 00:13:23,680
我们能就这么让它过去吗
Can we please move past this?

371
00:13:23,680 --> 00:13:24,560
我不知道
I don't know.

372
00:13:25,179 --> 00:13:26,579
我们说过彼此相爱
Um, we said that we loved each other.

373
00:13:26,579 --> 00:13:28,021
我信任过你
I-I trusted you.

374
00:13:28,940 --> 00:13:30,860
我现在只想挂掉你的电话
What I want to do is hang up on you right now.

375
00:13:30,960 --> 00:13:31,860
等等 我
Wait, I --

376
00:13:33,820 --> 00:13:37,025
我告诉他了 简直不能更糟了
Well, I told him, and it couldn't have gone worse.

377
00:13:37,025 --> 00:13:38,000
-不要啊 -我很遗憾
- Oh, no. - Oh, I'm sorry.

378
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:40,220
-他跟你分手了 -还没有
- He broke up with you. - Not yet.

379
00:13:40,220 --> 00:13:41,995
他只是挂了我电话
He just hung up on me.

380
00:13:41,995 --> 00:13:43,920
过来 宝贝
Oh, come here, honey.

381
00:13:43,920 --> 00:13:46,960
我 我很遗憾 我理解你为什么不来找我了
I'm -- I'm so sorry, and I know why you didn't come to me.

382
00:13:47,120 --> 00:13:49,440
我一直都不怎么喜欢迪兰
I haven't always been Dylan's biggest fan.

383
00:13:49,440 --> 00:13:51,120
你可是把他推进一个蜂窝
You pushed him into a beehive.

384
00:13:51,340 --> 00:13:53,160
公平地说 我是把他从你身边推开
You know, to be fair, I pushed him off of you,

385
00:13:53,160 --> 00:13:54,720
他自己摔进蜂窝的
and he fell into the beehive,

386
00:13:55,280 --> 00:13:58,500
但是 不管怎么说 我想支持你
but, regardless, I want to be supportive.

387
00:13:58,560 --> 00:14:00,340
绝对不评判 我保证 我保证
No judgment. I promise. I promise.

388
00:14:00,580 --> 00:14:02,700
我简直不敢相信自己这么蠢
I can't believe how stupid I was.

389
00:14:03,020 --> 00:14:04,160
我让迪兰扰乱了我的内心
I let Dylan get in my head,

390
00:14:04,160 --> 00:14:05,940
现在我和阿尔文的感情可能都被毁了
and now I might have ruined everything with Arvin.

391
00:14:06,300 --> 00:14:06,720
那么
So...

392
00:14:06,720 --> 00:14:09,220
通过这件事我们可以学到
what we're learning is that

393
00:14:09,220 --> 00:14:11,240
有时候 秘密还是不说出来为好
sometimes it is better to keep the secret.

394
00:14:11,400 --> 00:14:12,820
你竟然有脸为此感到骄傲
You can't be proud of that.

395
00:14:13,560 --> 00:14:15,320
宝贝 其实这种事也是常有发生的
Look, honey, sometimes these things happen.

396
00:14:15,320 --> 00:14:16,220
在他们身上发生过
They happened with them,

397
00:14:16,220 --> 00:14:17,640
结果却发展成了一件好事
but that turned out to be a good thing.

398
00:14:17,760 --> 00:14:18,760
不好意思 怎么就是好事了
I'm sorry. In what way?

399
00:14:18,760 --> 00:14:21,440
因为米奇尔在酒吧亲完那个人之后
Because after Mitchell kissed the guy in the bar,

400
00:14:21,520 --> 00:14:23,160
哭着给我打了电话
he called me crying,

401
00:14:24,440 --> 00:14:25,400
肝肠寸断啊
so tortured.

402
00:14:25,620 --> 00:14:27,440
他说他亲下去的那一瞬间
He said the second he did it,

403
00:14:27,440 --> 00:14:31,080
他就意识到他想和小卡共度余生
he knew he wanted to spend the rest of his life with Cam.

404
00:14:31,380 --> 00:14:32,840
米奇尔 真的吗 你为什么不早说呢
Mitchell, is that true? Why didn't you say that?

405
00:14:32,840 --> 00:14:35,860
因为我们都在一起15年了 小卡
Because we've been together for 15 years, Cam.

406
00:14:35,860 --> 00:14:37,480
我刚刚太想维护自己了 抱歉
I got defensive. I'm sorry.

407
00:14:37,940 --> 00:14:39,920
不 该道歉的是我
No. I'm sorry.

408
00:14:40,460 --> 00:14:41,560
是我失控了
You know, I freaked out,

409
00:14:41,560 --> 00:14:43,700
我只顾考虑我自己了
and I made this whole day about myself.

410
00:14:43,700 --> 00:14:46,340
你是对的 我有时以自我为中心 又很情绪化
And you're right -- I can be self-centered and emotional.

411
00:14:47,850 --> 00:14:49,120
我觉得
I guess it's, you know,

412
00:14:49,120 --> 00:14:51,640
是因为我爸爸和他的猪在一起太久的缘故
because of all that time my daddy spent with his pigs.

413
00:14:51,740 --> 00:14:54,380
-小卡 拜托 该闭嘴了 -嗯
- Cam. Please. It's time. - Mm-hmm.

414
00:14:56,240 --> 00:14:58,760
海莉 你不是个坏人
Haley, you're not a bad person.

415
00:14:58,760 --> 00:15:01,240
也许这个吻告诉了你一些你需要知道的事
Maybe this kiss taught you something you needed to know,

416
00:15:01,240 --> 00:15:02,600
就像米奇舅舅那样
just like it did with Uncle Mitch.

417
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:04,200
如果是那样的话
If that's the case,

418
00:15:04,560 --> 00:15:06,860
你需要去争取你爱的那个人
you need to fight for the man you love

419
00:15:06,860 --> 00:15:08,540
并且果断离开你不爱的人
and shut it down with the one you don't.

420
00:15:09,517 --> 00:15:10,520
-你说得对 -嗯嗯
- You're right. - Mm-hmm.

421
00:15:10,520 --> 00:15:12,380
-我得去见迪兰 -好的
- I have to go see Dylan. - Okay.

422
00:15:13,360 --> 00:15:16,399
坚强一点 不要让他掌控你
Be strong. Don't let him manipulate you.

423
00:15:16,399 --> 00:15:18,389
-他有时候很... -她可以的
- He can be a very em-- - She's good.

424
00:15:19,400 --> 00:15:20,040
她没事的
She's good.

425
00:15:23,311 --> 00:15:25,635
真高兴你出来了[出柜]
Ah, so happy that you came out.

426
00:15:25,820 --> 00:15:26,980
你怎么回事
What's going on with you?

427
00:15:27,120 --> 00:15:28,299
你从哪弄到这么个气垫
Where did you get that raft?

428
00:15:28,299 --> 00:15:32,015
从一个超级感人的同志活动送的礼品袋里
It was in a gift bag from a very moving Pride benefit

429
00:15:32,015 --> 00:15:33,900
我和米奇还有小卡一起去的
that I went to with Mitch and Cam.

430
00:15:33,900 --> 00:15:35,860
你要是想知道我是不是同性恋 直接问我好了
If you want to know if I'm gay, just ask me.

431
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:37,920
不 我不想给你太大压力
No, I don't want to be pushy.

432
00:15:38,600 --> 00:15:40,020
我喜欢女人 妈
I like women, Mom!

433
00:15:40,140 --> 00:15:41,540
你怎么会觉得我是同性恋呢
Why on earth would you think I'm gay?

434
00:15:41,540 --> 00:15:43,840
公平地说 你确实符合基佬的很多特征
In fairness, you do check a lot of the boxes.

435
00:15:44,600 --> 00:15:46,480
我会这么想是因为杰说
I only thought it because Jay said

436
00:15:46,480 --> 00:15:48,780
加拿大女朋友是假的
that the Canadian girlfriends are fake

437
00:15:48,780 --> 00:15:50,740
而且米奇和小卡也有过加拿大女朋友
and that Mitch and Cam had them.

438
00:15:50,840 --> 00:15:52,340
你觉得我的女朋友是假的
You think my girlfriend is fake?

439
00:15:52,500 --> 00:15:54,060
你一张照片都没有
Well, you didn't have any pictures,

440
00:15:54,060 --> 00:15:56,060
而且在吧台那儿 你说她的名字
and at the bar, you said that her name

441
00:15:56,060 --> 00:15:59,200
叫什么橄榄·鸡尾酒-餐巾纸
was something like Olive Cocktail-napkin.

442
00:15:59,260 --> 00:16:00,340
是雪莉·桃久奇
It's Sherry Shaker!

443
00:16:00,540 --> 00:16:01,760
我很抱歉
I am sorry,

444
00:16:02,120 --> 00:16:05,500
但是我问你有没有瞒着我什么的时候
but when I asked you if you were hiding something from me,

445
00:16:05,500 --> 00:16:08,420
你就变得很防备 你还羞辱了我的胸
you got all defensive, and you boob-shamed me.

446
00:16:08,420 --> 00:16:09,880
因为确实有事情发生
Because something did happen.

447
00:16:10,520 --> 00:16:12,020
雪莉和我
Sherry and I...

448
00:16:12,020 --> 00:16:14,320
我们携手
we joined our...

449
00:16:14,320 --> 00:16:15,940
我们打开了美丽新世界的大门
We crossed that beauteous threshold

450
00:16:15,940 --> 00:16:17,780
用肉体缠绵互诉真情
into the physical expression of love.

451
00:16:17,980 --> 00:16:20,840
你什么时候听到过一个直男那样形容性爱
Have you ever heard a straight guy describe sex that way?

452
00:16:21,240 --> 00:16:21,980
他原来是这个意思吗
That's what he meant?

453
00:16:22,340 --> 00:16:24,100
我怎么觉得听了更难受
Why does that feel worse to me?

454
00:16:24,840 --> 00:16:26,800
艾丽克斯 你是最后一个处子了
Hey, Alex. You're the last virgin.

455
00:16:27,620 --> 00:16:29,700
拜托 我可是在和一个消防员约会
Please, I'm dating a fireman.

456
00:16:29,760 --> 00:16:32,320
我的性生活火辣得比...
I'm having hotter sex than...

457
00:16:34,140 --> 00:16:34,960
你好啊 爸
Hey, Dad?

458
00:16:35,340 --> 00:16:36,360
你在干什么
What are you doing?

459
00:16:41,820 --> 00:16:42,700
他不会的
He wouldn't.

460
00:16:43,953 --> 00:16:46,400
我意识到他在"以彼之贱 还施彼身"
I realized he was "Mean Girls-ing" Me back

461
00:16:46,400 --> 00:16:48,498
并且加入了《律政俏佳人》的某些招式
with a weird nod to "Legally Blonde,"

462
00:16:48,498 --> 00:16:50,340
我敢说他不知道我注意到了
which I'll bet he thinks I didn't notice.

463
00:16:50,340 --> 00:16:51,360
我得改变战术了
I had to change tactics.

464
00:16:51,780 --> 00:16:53,060
我不能再像一个贱女孩那样
I had to stop acting like a mean girl

465
00:16:53,060 --> 00:16:55,780
我要做让杰意想不到的事
and do the last thing Jay would ever expect me to do --

466
00:16:55,780 --> 00:16:56,980
就是像个男人一样
act like a man.

467
00:16:57,520 --> 00:16:58,560
你这是搞什么鬼
What the hell are you doing?!

468
00:16:58,660 --> 00:17:00,280
大家都饿了
Oh, yeah, well, everybody's hungry,

469
00:17:00,280 --> 00:17:01,720
而且大家都觉得
and the prevailing opinion is that

470
00:17:01,720 --> 00:17:03,000
我比你更会烤肉
I'm a better griller than you.

471
00:17:03,720 --> 00:17:06,780
-完了 -哇 你自以为是硬汉对吧
- No. - Wow. You must think you're pretty tough.

472
00:17:06,780 --> 00:17:08,960
-没你烤的肉硬 -克莱尔
- Not as tough as your meat. - Claire!

473
00:17:08,960 --> 00:17:11,260
没错 很好 所有人都出来
Yes, good, everybody get out here!

474
00:17:11,280 --> 00:17:12,560
怎么了 出什么事了
What? What's going on?

475
00:17:12,820 --> 00:17:14,760
是菲尔 菲尔要烤肉了
It's Phil! Phil is grilling!

476
00:17:15,100 --> 00:17:17,080
这个傻蛋刚刚告诉我
This bozo just told me

477
00:17:17,080 --> 00:17:18,780
你们认为我烤的肉太老了
that you think I overcook your meat.

478
00:17:18,900 --> 00:17:19,800
是真的吗
Is that true?

479
00:17:22,660 --> 00:17:23,180
卢克
Luke?!

480
00:17:28,400 --> 00:17:30,180
爸 我们爱你 不过
Dad, we love you, but...

481
00:17:30,799 --> 00:17:32,815
你真的不懂什么叫三分熟
you don't know what medium-rare is.

482
00:17:32,815 --> 00:17:34,340
我已经连续三年父亲节
I've-I've given you a meat thermometer

483
00:17:34,340 --> 00:17:35,720
送你烤肉温度计了
for three Father's Days in a row.

484
00:17:35,780 --> 00:17:37,260
看在老天份上 求你用用吧
For the love of God, just use one!

485
00:17:37,320 --> 00:17:39,220
那好 我才不在乎
Fine. See if I care.

486
00:17:39,480 --> 00:17:41,680
但我不知道你今天跟我较什么劲
But I don't know what you have against me today --

487
00:17:41,700 --> 00:17:43,070
把我赶下我的烤架
kicking a man off his own grill,

488
00:17:43,070 --> 00:17:44,991
笑话我的冰镇薄荷杰丽普酒
making fun of my Mint Jay-leps.

489
00:17:45,282 --> 00:17:47,910
你笑话他的冰镇薄荷杰丽普
You made fun of his Mint Jay-leps?

490
00:17:47,920 --> 00:17:49,420
那是他专门为你调的
He did them for you.

491
00:17:49,960 --> 00:17:51,598
-什么 -我不知道她在胡说什么
- What? - I don't know what she's talking about.

492
00:17:51,598 --> 00:17:54,200
杰一想到冰镇"薄荷杰丽普"这个点子
The minute Jay created the Jay-leps,

493
00:17:54,200 --> 00:17:56,597
就一直在说
all he could keep saying was,

494
00:17:56,597 --> 00:17:58,600
"菲尔肯定超喜欢这个名字双关的美酒"
"Phil's gonna get such a kick out of this."

495
00:17:58,600 --> 00:18:00,120
可他不喜欢 他说这点子很蠢
But he didn't! He said it was dumb!

496
00:18:00,460 --> 00:18:01,920
他说那是老太太喝的
He said it was an old lady's drink!

497
00:18:02,180 --> 00:18:04,040
你什么时候在意起我的想法了
Since when do you care what I think?

498
00:18:04,360 --> 00:18:04,800
一直啊
Always!

499
00:18:05,300 --> 00:18:07,020
他觉得你是每一场派对的活力源泉
He thinks that you're the life of the party.

500
00:18:07,020 --> 00:18:08,220
他想变得像你一样
He wants to be more like you.

501
00:18:08,520 --> 00:18:10,500
我只是说 有时候
All I've said is that sometimes

502
00:18:10,500 --> 00:18:13,360
我嫉妒那些不介意出洋相的人
I envy people who don't mind being an ass

503
00:18:13,360 --> 00:18:14,420
因为他们玩得很开心
because they're having fun,

504
00:18:14,420 --> 00:18:16,020
我想
and I guess...

505
00:18:16,800 --> 00:18:17,720
你就是那种人
you're one of those people.

506
00:18:17,940 --> 00:18:20,380
所以这些年来你一直对我很刻薄
Wow, so all this time, you've been mean to me

507
00:18:20,380 --> 00:18:22,260
是因为你特别羡慕我
because you admire me so much?

508
00:18:22,540 --> 00:18:24,400
来 看着我
Hey, look at me.

509
00:18:25,016 --> 00:18:27,380
我很喜欢你的冰镇薄荷杰丽普
I loved those Mint Jay-leps.

510
00:18:27,780 --> 00:18:28,899
-真的吗 -真的
- You did? - Yeah.

511
00:18:28,899 --> 00:18:30,480
你听见了吗 歌洛莉亚 他喜欢
Did you hear that, Gloria? He did.

512
00:18:30,480 --> 00:18:32,500
我说那酒不好只是因为婚礼那天
I only trashed them because of what you called me

513
00:18:32,500 --> 00:18:33,618
你在我跳舞时给我起外号
when I was dancing at the wedding.

514
00:18:33,618 --> 00:18:35,501
什么外号 菲鹅·邓菲
What? Flail Dunphy?

515
00:18:35,564 --> 00:18:36,679
傻尔·笨妹
Shrill Dummy?

516
00:18:36,679 --> 00:18:38,520
你弄洒饮料时我说了洒尔·蹬飞
When you dropped your drink -- Spill Bumbly?

517
00:18:38,520 --> 00:18:39,400
迈克尔·抽筋逊
Michael Jerkson.

518
00:18:39,700 --> 00:18:41,460
是哦 这个我倒是忘了
Oh, yeah. I forgot about that one.

519
00:18:41,500 --> 00:18:42,137
对不起
I'm sorry.

520
00:18:42,137 --> 00:18:44,343
别在意了
Oh, don't-don't worry about it.

521
00:18:44,343 --> 00:18:45,440
这是在做什么
What are we doing?

522
00:18:45,440 --> 00:18:46,320
你刚叫我"好小子"了吗
Did you just call me "Sport"?

523
00:18:51,020 --> 00:18:51,460
海莉
Haley.

524
00:18:51,840 --> 00:18:53,220
我有预感会是你
I had a feeling it was gonna be you.

525
00:18:53,440 --> 00:18:54,540
是你给我开的大门
You buzzed me in the gate.

526
00:18:54,760 --> 00:18:57,180
-你有时间吗 -当然 我和室友
- Do you have a minute? - Sure, my roommates and I

527
00:18:57,180 --> 00:18:58,840
不过在为生理学期中考复习而已
are just studying for physiology midterms.

528
00:18:59,560 --> 00:19:01,340
-她真可爱 -谢了 妹子
- Oh, she cute. - Thanks, girl.

529
00:19:01,340 --> 00:19:02,320
你的发型太完美了
That hair is on point.

530
00:19:02,580 --> 00:19:03,640
我昨天刚买的
I bought it yesterday.

531
00:19:04,300 --> 00:19:06,440
我们能出来聊聊吗
Can we talk out here?

532
00:19:10,520 --> 00:19:12,040
听着 我得让你知道
Listen, I need you to know that

533
00:19:12,040 --> 00:19:13,300
那天我根本不该吻你
that kiss never should have happened.

534
00:19:13,760 --> 00:19:16,320
阿尔文和我在交往 而我们只是朋友
Arvin and I are together, and you and I are friends,

535
00:19:16,320 --> 00:19:18,060
并且永远只会是朋友
and that's all we're ever going to be.

536
00:19:18,060 --> 00:19:19,480
不了 谢谢
No, thank you.

537
00:19:19,680 --> 00:19:21,940
"不了 谢谢" 我又没问你想怎样
"No, thank you"? I didn't ask you a question.

538
00:19:22,200 --> 00:19:23,460
那让我问问你
Well, let me ask you one.

539
00:19:23,840 --> 00:19:26,440
已经十年了 我总是不能放下你
It's been 10 years, and I can't move on from you.

540
00:19:26,980 --> 00:19:28,320
这也不是提问
Also not a question.

541
00:19:28,740 --> 00:19:29,960
还记得我们相遇那天吗
Remember the day we met?

542
00:19:30,160 --> 00:19:31,580
我走在走廊里
I was walking through the halls,

543
00:19:31,580 --> 00:19:33,700
看到了这世上最漂亮的女孩
and I saw the most beautiful girl,

544
00:19:33,700 --> 00:19:35,720
我说 "那是谁"
and I was like, "Whoa! Who is that?"

545
00:19:35,840 --> 00:19:37,540
然后你说"那是丽贝卡·萨尔金"
And you were like, "That's Rebecca Salkin."

546
00:19:37,640 --> 00:19:39,740
然后我转身 第一次看到了你
And then I turned and saw you for the first time,

547
00:19:39,740 --> 00:19:41,580
我立刻就忘了丽贝卡·萨尔金
and I was done with Rebecca Salkin.

548
00:19:42,040 --> 00:19:45,560
当时你穿着那件很酷的破军装外套
Yeah, you were wearing that cool, beat-up Army jacket,

549
00:19:45,560 --> 00:19:48,140
我特别嫉妒你的长睫毛
and I was completely jealous of your eyelashes.

550
00:19:50,160 --> 00:19:50,640
海莉
Haley...

551
00:19:50,640 --> 00:19:53,120
那天我就爱上了你 从没停止过爱你
I fell in love with you that day, and I've never stopped.

552
00:19:53,680 --> 00:19:56,480
我会一直让自己变得更好 直到配得上你
I'm gonna keep making myself better until I deserve you.

553
00:20:01,500 --> 00:20:04,400
为什么在感情中坦诚相待这么难
Why is it so hard to be honest in relationships?

554
00:20:05,200 --> 00:20:06,740
我们耍小把戏
We play games.

555
00:20:06,820 --> 00:20:08,220
我们藏起秘密
We keep secrets...

556
00:20:10,880 --> 00:20:12,920
我不记得向你哭诉那个吻的事
I don't remember crying to you about that kiss.

557
00:20:13,380 --> 00:20:14,800
说实话又无法拔除他心中的那根刺
The truth wasn't moving the needle.

558
00:20:15,080 --> 00:20:15,720
不客气
You're welcome.

559
00:20:15,920 --> 00:20:17,800
而我们分明只想心心相印
when all we want to do is connect.

560
00:20:18,100 --> 00:20:19,300
大家 注意听
Everyone, listen up!

561
00:20:19,780 --> 00:20:20,520
大家好 我是雪利
Hi, I'm Sherry.

562
00:20:20,880 --> 00:20:22,800
我是曼尼真实存在的加拿大女友
I'm Manny's real Canadian girlfriend.

563
00:20:23,620 --> 00:20:25,180
这不是我第一次被迫证明自己的存在了
This isn't the first time I've had to do this.

564
00:20:29,100 --> 00:20:31,820
我想我们得先从对自己诚实开始
I guess we have to start with being honest with ourselves.

565
00:20:33,480 --> 00:20:35,460
假如要我说实话
And if I'm being honest...

566
00:20:37,440 --> 00:20:38,520
我爱上了两个人
I love two people.

567
00:20:40,620 --> 00:20:41,180
见鬼
Damn it!

568
00:20:41,836 --> 00:20:44,340
我们能走了吗 我们是在等蛋糕吗
Can we go? Are we waiting for cake, or...?

569
00:20:44,340 --> 00:20:46,976
-是谁的生日吗 -我该说段祝酒词吗
- Is it a birthday? - Should I make a toast?

570
00:20:46,976 --> 00:20:48,000
-敬什么 -敬谁
- To what? - To whom?

571
00:20:48,000 --> 00:20:51,682
好吧 通过一系列的假设
All right! It's come to my attention through series of assumptions,

572
00:20:51,682 --> 00:20:54,360
旧电邮和蹩脚的思考 我注意到
old e-mails and lazy sheep-like thingking,

573
00:20:54,360 --> 00:20:56,460
我们可能没什么理由就来聚会了
that we may have gathered for no reason.

574
00:20:57,360 --> 00:20:58,677
所以这不是欢迎我回家的派对吗
So, it's not my welcome home party?

575
00:20:58,677 --> 00:20:59,946
-当然是 -不是
- Of course it- - No!

576
00:20:59,946 --> 00:21:01,780
你妈以为艾丽克斯得了奖
Your mother thought Alex won a award,

577
00:21:01,780 --> 00:21:03,680
她没有 干旱期还在持续
she didn't, and the dry spell continues.

578
00:21:04,140 --> 00:21:06,340
拜托 我最近雨露丰沛...
Please, the last thing I'm having is a dry sp-

579
00:21:08,820 --> 00:21:09,940
大家听好
People, listen up!

580
00:21:10,220 --> 00:21:12,500
我们平时需要聚会的真实原因已经够多了
There's too many actual reasons for us to see each other,

581
00:21:12,640 --> 00:21:15,320
我们受不起这样失误乱聚
we cannot afford to hang out by mistake.

582
00:21:15,460 --> 00:21:17,200
我爱你们所有人 都滚回家吧
I love you all, now go home.

583
00:21:17,200 --> 00:21:18,970
-好吧 -我们走
- Alright, great. - Alright, let's go.
